{
  "markdown": "##### [cppreference.com](https://en.cppreference.com/index.html)\n\n[Create account](https://en.cppreference.com/mwiki/index.php?title=Special:UserLogin&returnto=cpp%2Futility%2Foptional&type=signup)\n\n- [Log in](https://en.cppreference.com/mwiki/index.php?title=Special:UserLogin&returnto=cpp%2Futility%2Foptional \"You are encouraged to log in; however, it is not mandatory [o]\")\n\n##### Namespaces\n\n- [Page](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/optional.html \"View the content page [c]\")\n- [Discussion](https://en.cppreference.com/w/Talk%253Acpp/utility/optional.html \"Discussion about the content page [t]\")\n\n##### Variants\n\n##### Views\n\n- [View](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/optional.html)\n- [Edit](https://en.cppreference.com/mwiki/index.php?title=cpp/utility/optional&action=edit \"You can edit this page. Please use the preview button before saving [e]\")\n- [History](https://en.cppreference.com/mwiki/index.php?title=cpp/utility/optional&action=history \"Past revisions of this page [h]\")\n\n##### Actions\n\n# std::optional\n\nFrom cppreference.com\n\n< [cpp](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp.html \"cpp\") \u200e \\| [utility](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility.html \"cpp/utility\")\n\n[C++](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp.html \"cpp\")\n\n|     |\n| --- |\n| [Compiler support](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/compiler_support.html \"cpp/compiler support\") |\n| [Freestanding and hosted](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/freestanding.html \"cpp/freestanding\") |\n| [Language](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language.html \"cpp/language\") |\n| [Standard library](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/standard_library.html \"cpp/standard library\") |\n| [Standard library headers](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/headers.html \"cpp/header\") |\n| [Named requirements](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/iterator/concepts.html \"cpp/named req\") |\n| [Feature test macros](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/feature_test.html \"cpp/feature test\")(C++20) |\n| [Language support library](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility.html#Language_support \"cpp/utility\") |\n| [Concepts library](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/concepts.html \"cpp/concepts\")(C++20) |\n| [Diagnostics library](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/error.html \"cpp/error\") |\n| [Memory management library](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/memory.html \"cpp/memory\") |\n| [Metaprogramming library](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/meta.html \"cpp/meta\")(C++11) |\n| [General utilities library](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility.html \"cpp/utility\") |\n| [Containers library](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container.html \"cpp/container\") |\n| [Iterators library](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/iterator.html \"cpp/iterator\") |\n| [Ranges library](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/ranges.html \"cpp/ranges\")(C++20) |\n| [Algorithms library](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/algorithm.html \"cpp/algorithm\") |\n| [Strings library](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/string.html \"cpp/string\") |\n| [Text processing library](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/text.html \"cpp/text\") |\n| [Numerics library](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/numeric.html \"cpp/numeric\") |\n| [Date and time library](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/chrono.html \"cpp/chrono\") |\n| [Input/output library](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io.html \"cpp/io\") |\n| [Filesystem library](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/filesystem.html \"cpp/filesystem\")(C++17) |\n| [Concurrency support library](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/atomic.html \"cpp/thread\")(C++11) |\n| [Execution control library](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/execution.html \"cpp/execution\")(C++26) |\n| [Technical specifications](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental.html \"cpp/experimental\") |\n| [Symbols index](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/symbol_index.html \"cpp/symbol index\") |\n| [External libraries](https://