5\"><a href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/links/libs.html\" title=\"cpp/links/libs\">External libraries</a></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div><div><span class=\"editsection noprint plainlinks\" title=\"Edit this template\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/mwiki/index.php?title=Template:cpp/navbar_content&amp;action=edit\">[edit]</a></span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"t-navbar-sep\">&nbsp;</div><div class=\"t-navbar-head\"><a href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility.html\" title=\"cpp/utility\">Utilities library</a><div class=\"t-navbar-menu\"><div><div><table class=\"t-nv-begin\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"\">\n<tbody><tr class=\"t-nv-col-table\"><td><div><table class=\"t-nv-begin\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"\">\n<tbody><tr class=\"t-nv-h1\"><td colspan=\"5\"><a href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility.html#Language_support\" title=\"cpp/utility\">Language support</a></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-nv\"><td colspan=\"5\"><a href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/rtti.html\" title=\"cpp/types\">Type support</a> (basic types, RTTI)</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-nv\"><td colspan=\"5\"><a href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/feature_test.html\" title=\"cpp/utility/feature test\">Library feature-test macros</a> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-nv\"><td colspan=\"5\"><a href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/program.html\" title=\"cpp/utility/program\">Program utilities</a></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-nv\"><td colspan=\"5\"><a href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/variadic.html\" title=\"cpp/utility/variadic\">Variadic functions</a></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-nv\"><td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"t-nv-ln-table\"><div><a href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/initializer_list.html\" title=\"cpp/utility/initializer list\"><span class=\"t-lines\"><span>initializer_list</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\">