omparable.html\" title=\"cpp/utility/compare/three way comparable\"><span class=\"t-lines\"><span>three_way_comparable</span><span>three_way_comparable_with</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-nv\"><td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"t-nv-ln-table\"><div><a href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/compare/strong_ordering.html\" title=\"cpp/utility/compare/strong ordering\"><span class=\"t-lines\"><span>strong_ordering</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-nv\"><td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"t-nv-ln-table\"><div><a href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/compare/weak_ordering.html\" title=\"cpp/utility/compare/weak ordering\"><span class=\"t-lines\"><span>weak_ordering</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-nv\"><td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"t-nv-ln-table\"><div><a href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/compare/partial_ordering.html\" title=\"cpp/utility/compare/partial ordering\"><span class=\"t-lines\"><span>partial_ordering</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-nv\"><td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"t-nv-ln-table\"><div><a href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/compare/common_comparison_category.html\" title=\"cpp/utility/compare/common comparison category\"><span class=\"t-lines\"><span>common_comparison_category</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div></td></tr>\n<tr cl